    "en": "Popcorn is Xiaoyan's round red-and-charcoal boar companion: sleepy-eyed, stubborn, a little grumpy, and quietly loyal. He has a white mohawk crest, dramatic white brows, tiny tusks, a peach-pink snout, and white-socked little hooves.",
